#                          selection states
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/ViewportPaintable.cpp (lines 175-596): the device-pixel CSS
#       transform, perspective and overflow clip of a box, the accumulated visual context tree
#       (effects, transforms, CSS clips, clip paths, perspectives, overflow clips and scrolls of
#       every paintable box), refreshing sticky and scroll offsets, and the selection state of
